        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>환율은 불변이고, 소득수준은 불변이다.</choice_text>
          <commentary>소득은 증가한다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
